@@ -21,6 +21,17 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Landscape report
+
+Create or refresh a landscape report (a portfolio view aggregating the repository analyses found under an analysis root):
+
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+* analyzeLandscape: Updates or creates a Sokrates landscape report, aggregating results of multiple analyses. The landscape counterpart of the analysis commands; the same as updateLandscape
+* updateLandscape: Updates or creates a Sokrates landscape report, aggregating results of multiple analyses (kept for existing scripts)
+
+Both commands accept the same options (e.g. `-analysisRoot`, `-recursive`, `-confFile`, `-date`, `-timeout`). Run `<command> -help` for details.
+
